`yellow`The King's Graveyard
`green`-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-

The unspeakable has happened to the land of Ambroshia!
The royal graveyard has been broken into and the Bones 
of King Tyberius has been stolen! 
@PAUSE@
King Tyberius was a GREAT leader of Ambroshia in years
gone by. To this day Ambroshia has Tyberius the Great 
Holidays, beautiful women toss flowers at his grave 
site daily and Knights still study his art of battle. 
King Tyberius is truly a landmark and an icon for 
Ambroshia!  
@PAUSE@
It's up to you to track down the and restore the bones 
of Tyberius from the thugs that would even think of 
such a foul travesty. 
@PAUSE@
`bright red`Your Quest Begins ...
@PAUSE@
You are grated access to the Royal Graveyard to start 
your investigations. You still see the `red`blood `grey`stains
of the 10 guards that died protecting the ancient King. 
Taking as many notes as you can, you head back to the 
Ambroshia tavern knowing full well you have no idea where 
to start.
@PAUSE@
